#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:0
msgid ""
"Find the accessibility menu on the top bar of Ubuntu Desktop, enable it in "
"Settings, and reach it using the keyboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:7
msgid "Topics: Accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:11
msgid "Find the accessibility menu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:13
msgid ""
"The *accessibility menu* is where you can turn on some of the accessibility "
"settings. You can find this menu by clicking the icon which looks like a "
"person on the top bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:15
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"![The accessibility menu can be found on the top bar.](person.png)\n"
"-->\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:19
msgid ""
"If you do not see the accessibility menu, you can enable it from the "
"Accessibility settings panel:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:21
msgid "Open the Activities overview and start typing **accessibility**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:22
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Accessibility` to open the panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:23
msgid "Enable the {guilabel}`Accessibility Menu` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/find-the-accessibility-menu.md:25
msgid ""
"To access this menu using the keyboard rather than the mouse, press {kbd}"
"`Ctrl+Alt+Tab` to move the keyboard focus to the top bar. The Activities "
"button in the top-left corner will get highlighted — this tells you which "
"item on the top bar is selected. Use the arrow keys on the keyboard to move "
"the selected item to the accessibility menu icon and then press {kbd}`Enter` "
"to open it. You can use the up and down arrow keys to select items in the "
"menu. Press {kbd}`Enter` to toggle the selected item."
msgstr ""
